{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49603","headline":"中兴乐 · 李珣","name":"中兴乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"後庭寂寂日初长，翩翩蝶舞红芳。\n绣帘垂地，金鸭无香，谁知春思如狂，忆萧郎。\n等闲一去，程遥信断，五岭三湘。\n休开鸾镜学宫妆，可能更理笙簧。\n倚屏凝睇，泪落成行，手寻裙带鸳鸯，暗思量。\n忍孤前约，教人花貌，虚老风光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}